# Observability: Events

Purpose:
  Define event architecture for observability: envelope, versioning,
  producers, consumers, bus configuration, and delivery guarantees.

Owns: architecture/observability/events.sdd

Principles:
  Events are immutable and append-only.
  Event ordering is guaranteed per execution_id.
  Event consumers MUST be idempotent.

EventEnvelope:
  structure:
    event:
      id: string
      type: string
      version: string
      timestamp: ISO 8601
      correlation_id: string
      causation_id: string
      actor: string
      source: string
      payload: object

EventVersioning:
  rule: event schemas are versioned
  example:
    ToolCalled.v1
    ToolCalled.v2

  rule: consumers MUST handle old event versions

EventProducer:
  examples:
    Execution Engine: ExecutionStarted
    Tool Runner: ToolCompleted

EventConsumer:
  examples:
    Observability Service: metrics, traces
    Audit Service: audit log
    Notification Service: alerts

EventBus:
  purpose: decouple producers from consumers
  properties:
    ordering: per execution_id
    delivery: at-least-once
    retry: with backoff
    dead-letter: DLQ for failed events
    idempotency: event_id based deduplication
    partitioning: by execution_id
    retention: configurable

DuplicateEvents:
  rule: consumers MUST be idempotent
  rule: deduplication by event_id

DeadLetterQueue:
  rule: failed events go to DLQ
  rule: DLQ is monitored and reprocessed

Ordering:
  rule: ordering is required per execution_id
  rule: global ordering is NOT required (too expensive)

EventCategories:
  DomainEvents:
    UserCreated, PaymentCompleted, OrderCancelled

  SystemEvents:
    ExecutionStarted, ToolCalled, ToolFailed, AgentAssigned, PolicyDenied

EndToEndTrace:
  structure:
    REQ-100
      ?
    TASK-200
      ?
    EXEC-300
      ?
    +-- AGENT-10
      ¦     +-- SKILL-20
      ¦     +-- CTX-30
      ¦     +-- PROMPT-40
      +-- POLICY-50
      +-- ACTION-60
      ¦     +-- TOOL-70
      +-- VALIDATION-80
      +-- ARTIFACT-90

  rule: every node has ID, Version, Timestamp, Actor, Parent, Correlation

Navigation:
  Architecture: @../INDEX.sdd
  System: @../system.sdd
  AI: @../ai.sdd
  Operations: @../operations.sdd

Rules:
  [OBS-05] Events are immutable and append-only.
  [OBS-06] Event ordering is guaranteed per execution_id.
  [OBS-07] Event consumers MUST be idempotent.
  [OBS-13] End-to-end trace links Requirement to Artifact.

State: +
